<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank says to seek more regional help.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank says to seek more regional help.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Thailand's Governor Rerngchai Marakanond said on Monday that the central bank would seek more regional cooperation to combat currency woes.</p>
<p>He also told reporters that he expected the shaky baht to stabilise within two to three months.</p>
</text>
